RESULTS (codec_wiki, highd protection cells — e7)
--------------------------------------------------

All 5 cells (d=2.5, 3.0, 4.0, 5.0, 6.0) BYTE-IDENTICAL across all 5
candidates → G3 + G4 PASS trivially.

  - d=2.5 / d=3.0: gate already firing at MIN=2.0 (baseline), no change
    when MIN goes lower.
  - d=4.0 / d=5.0 / d=6.0: gate disabled by MAX=3.5 ceiling regardless
    of MIN value → W44-135 protection preserved.

RESULTS (terminal, e8/e9 × d=1.0..2.0)
---------------------------------------

All 12 terminal cells BYTE-IDENTICAL across all 5 candidates → G5 PASS.

Mechanism: terminal m3_colourfulness=13.85 < W44_124_DCT32_KEEP_M3_MIN
(60) — m3 gate rejects regardless of distance.

RESULTS (photo: 1418519 e7 d=4)
-------------------------------

BYTE-IDENTICAL across all 5 candidates → G6 PASS.

Mechanism: CID22 photo edge_density >= 0.16 fails the ed gate.
Additionally d=4.0 sits above MAX=3.5 anyway.

